# AI-T7 — keep model artefacts out of git.
#
# Models are operator-supplied + license-unclear at minimum
# (~38 MB binary blobs). The dev workflow points the WAF at
# `data/ai_model/waf_model.onnx` via `make ai-link MODEL=…`,
# which symlinks an out-of-tree file. The directory itself
# (with this .gitignore + README + label_map) lives in git so
# the path stays stable.

# All .onnx blobs (real + symlinked).
# *.onnx

# Reference text dump from the trainer (52 MB, treat like a
# binary).
# *.txt

# Operator-side training pipeline / scratch (the upstream
# `src/` tree is reference-only; treat as ephemeral).
src/
target/
Cargo.lock

# Allow the ones that DO belong in git.
!README.md
!.gitignore
!label_map.json
!WAF_DATASET_REPORT_VI.md
!Cargo.toml
